{"id":"n71332-1-3","stage":2,"title":"아무런 · 什么","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71332-1-3-1","ko":"정말 걔랑 나는 아무런 사이도 아니야.","zh":"我和他真的没有任何关系啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"걔랑","meaning":"“그 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。","explanation":"걔：“그 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。；랑：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"걔","audio":"/audio/6488cd1503b8fc1cb5fa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64369","senseId":"1","lemma":"걔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아무런","meaning":"什么","explanation":"아무런：什么","readings":[{"term":"아무런","audio":"/audio/79942a159da2d83cd853.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71332","senseId":"1","lemma":"아무런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사이도","meaning":"关系","explanation":"사이：关系；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"사이","audio":"/audio/01aa8d172f6fe0b5d3b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61187","senseId":"4","lemma":"사이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아니야.","meaning":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","explanation":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"아니야","audio":"/audio/b8a273e5d75f1fd1734c.mp3"}],"sources":[]}],"words":[{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"6488cd1503b8fc1c","term":"걔","zh":"“그 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/6488cd1503b8fc1cb5fa.mp3","entryId":"64369","definition":"“그 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/