","explanation":"다니다：常去；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"다니다","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29702","senseId":"1","lemma":"다니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"건데?","meaning":"所说的事情、情况（것 的口语形式）","explanation":"거：所说的事情、情况（것 的口语形式）；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"79942a159da2d83c","term":"아무런","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/79942a159da2d83cd853.mp3","entryId":"71332","definition":"没有任何。","pronunciation":["아ː무런"]},{"id":"01aa8d172f6fe0b5","term":"사이","zh":"关系","audio":"/audio/01aa8d172f6fe0b5d3b5.mp3","entryId":"61187","definition":"相互结交的关系或结交后亲密的程度。","pronunciation":["사이"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"d5d6a44c9a892452","term":"매일","zh":"每日，天天","audio":"/audio/d5d6a44c9a8924522b29.mp3","entryId":"58103","definition":"一天一天的每一天。","pronunciation":["매ː일"]},{"id":"6d2b6bbf82785e6d","term":"함께","zh":"一起，共同，与共","audio":"/audio/6d2b6bbf82785e6dce3d.mp3","entryId":"72465","definition":"许多人一下子同时。","pronunciation":["함께"]},{"id":"02309ed22c9c3627","term":"다니다","zh":"常去","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3","entryId":"29702","definition":"经常出入某个地方。","pronunciation":["다니다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"所说的事情、情况（것 的口语形式）","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"所说的事情、情况（것 的口语形式）","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/be56986edb8a04a6323c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.598,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71332","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":84,"sequenceScore":2.3233,"question